#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:5
#: f7e34f05a7854c969a97e6eefd602e77
msgid "KOGGER Underwater Sonar"
msgstr "KOGGER 水下声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:8
#: fb614119a9d34f82b4bde9c71f1b09aa
msgid ""
"The `KOGGER Sonar <https://kogger.tech/product/sonar-2d-enhanced>`__ is a "
"compact and low-cost underwater echosounder module with UART interface, "
"5-14Volts Power Supply Voltage."
msgstr ""
"`KOGGER 声呐 <https://kogger.tech/product/sonar-2d-enhanced>`__ "
"是一款紧凑型低成本水下回声测深仪模块，具有 UART 接口，供电电压为 5-14V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:15
#: f0de38676593453e963849bd0300a18c
msgid "Recommended Hardware"
msgstr "推荐硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:16
#: a87e08f4f5e848439bfaeee3ff28ad6e
msgid ""
"CP210x USB->UART converter and Windows PC with `Kogger Application "
"<https://github.com/koggertech/KoggerApp/releases/latest>`__ installed."
msgstr ""
"CP210x USB 转 UART 转换器，以及安装了 `Kogger 应用程序 "
"<https://github.com/koggertech/KoggerApp/releases/latest>`__ 的 Windows 电脑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:19
#: e20e1ecce1924681bf7e2afb428984ad
msgid "Configuring the echosounder module"
msgstr "配置回声测深仪模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:20
#: 2c38b86731c948d88bebc661339861d6
msgid ""
"The module should be configured before it is connected to the ArduPilot. You"
" need the KOGGER Sonar module connected to computer. The GUI is opensource "
"`Kogger Application <https://github.com/koggertech/KoggerApp/>`__."
msgstr ""
"该模块在连接到 ArduPilot 之前应先进行配置。需要将 KOGGER 声呐模块连接到电脑。GUI 为开源的 `Kogger 应用程序 "
"<https://github.com/koggertech/KoggerApp/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:24
#: 6332725c3c5949a48326f32cf7367ac7
msgid "Make the following adjustment in the GUI:"
msgstr "在 GUI 中进行以下调整："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:29
#: 991a64a3749d403483ab814df552fc0d
msgid "Select the assigned COM-port and press green RUN button"
msgstr "选择分配的 COM 端口并按绿色 RUN 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:32
#: 50cd5be9905548cfa6cb61a3da9fbaae
msgid "Set the following rangefinder parameters:"
msgstr "设置以下测距仪参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:31
#: 5a135b2a9e3840199757d745966f4e12
msgid "Max distance = 50000"
msgstr "最大距离 = 50000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:32
#: fcf3eff9eb75407f92b35e2c881d8b3f
msgid "Dead zone = 100"
msgstr "死区 = 100"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:33
#: a1a49e09fb0e4d15b235cecd40bac241
msgid "Confidence = 0"
msgstr "置信度 = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:36
#: 7d69dc85719e4fcab0541c2608baba50
msgid "Set the following transducer parameters:"
msgstr "设置以下换能器参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:35
#: 2c42536d80ec4e4aa38a4549fd36ade0
msgid "Pulse count = 10"
msgstr "脉冲数 = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:36
#: dc781de6de97477e9158a28c37fea9c1
msgid "Frequency = 700kHz"
msgstr "频率 = 700kHz"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:37
#: d498881718c9447aa70ac84f8c522b3d
msgid "Booster = ON"
msgstr "增压器 = 开"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:39
#: 5403e2fa8e31464a97d5afd9a571c289
msgid "Set the following dataset parameters:"
msgstr "设置以下数据集参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:39
#: 7ec85daaa5eb4c1a80d46c8ec63e303a
msgid "Period = 100ms"
msgstr "周期 = 100ms"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:40
#: 4818ef4fa3274094b7da097b12a9c47c
msgid "Rangefinder = NMEA"
msgstr "测距仪 = NMEA"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:41
#: 52137cf284da4d29bb0ba752709f033f
msgid "Press \"Flash settings\""
msgstr "按 「Flash settings」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:43
#: afda16cbb2554ff7917d4915a5d6b00e
msgid "That’s it. The module is ready to use with autopilot."
msgstr "就这样。模块已准备好与飞控配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:46
#: f6b5dfc67c1b4e29a7e98da5fe5fd61e
msgid "Connecting to the ArduPilot hardware"
msgstr "连接到 ArduPilot 硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:47
#: 08a41aa68a2540b28c5b764ebd7ea091
msgid ""
"The KOGGER Sonar provides distance measurements using the NMEA protocol over"
" serial/uart."
msgstr "KOGGER 声呐通过串口/UART 使用 NMEA 协议提供距离测量数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:49
#: 53beb8048fde4e669ed08265f8443a88
msgid ""
"If the SERIAL2 (TELEM2) is used then the following parameters should be set:"
msgstr "如果使用 SERIAL2（TELEM2），则应设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:54
#: 2f98020454b74b11b95c969f20779d81
msgid ""
"The sensor can be connected to any available serial/uart port on the "
"autopilot. In the diagram below the first sensor is connected to SERIAL2 "
"(TELEM2)."
msgstr "传感器可连接到飞控上任何可用的串口/UART 端口。下图中第一个传感器连接到 SERIAL2（TELEM2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:58
#: d2b32b55ca6e41939e4c17c3afc6adc4
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:59
#: 33d2b732cfe34ccb9780f284ee44c906
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:61
#: f3e05fa737f142db9d992f031a431bab
msgid "Then the following range finder related parameters should be set:"
msgstr "然后应设置以下测距仪相关参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:63
#: 331ae37a4c124f20b314df5f58fcde12
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17（NMEA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:64
#: a9d23aeeede9452aa2476b8162ad1f14
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.3"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:65
#: 3e20d1dc1a5b46c4810d08b3a894f66e
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 50 (i.e. 50m).  *This is the distance in "
"meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 50（即 50m）。*这是测距仪可以可靠读取的距离（米）。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:66
#: 5491477bb0e24eb5a9b998934c4b7400
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (i.e. down) if mounted on a boat"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（即向下），如果安装在船上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:70
#: c9fc8a944d984a2d9877b034a93ace20
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-kogger-sonar.rst:72
#: 3261e5733d43402fab38dc51ae54e276
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
